  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Immediately after you cast a spell with a spell slot that restores Hit Points to a creature or ends a condition on it, you can cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDispelMagi]{Dispel Magic} as part of the same action, Bonus Action, or Reaction, without expending a spell slot. Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Short or Long Rest, but you can restore it by expending one use of Channel Divinity (no action required).</p>",
